# Scene/chat blobs dumped out of a live playthrough while debugging. These are
# play content, not engine source -- one was picked up by a release rsync and
# very nearly published. Untracked is not enough on its own: the release path
# copies the working tree wholesale, so anything not ignored here ships.
*_backup_*.json
scene_chat*.json

# Pipeline diagnostics can contain story text, retrieved lore, and private
# character reasoning when exported with --include-content. Keep generated
# traces local unless someone deliberately renames/adds a scrubbed fixture.
*.trace.json
